# SITE5 (2026-08-18): /knowledge/wholesale-price-formation/ had a DIRECTORY and no entry in
# site/data/knowledge_wholesale.json, so the shared topic template rendered its own raw slug
# as the page title, with no blurb, no scope and no linked topics -- a published page that
# said nothing and named nothing. Nothing in the site linked to it and the Knowledge index
# never listed it, so it was reachable only by a crawler or a guessed URL.
#
# It is not written, because it is a DUPLICATE: its subject is exactly
# /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/, whose own title is "How Great Britain's wholesale
# electricity price is formed". Writing it would have produced two pages competing to explain
# one mechanism -- the warehousing mistake the brief objects to, in miniature.
#
# Redirected rather than deleted, per this file's own standing convention: the directory
# stays in-repo (noindex, unreachable canonically) for reference.
/knowledge/wholesale-price-formation /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/ 301
/knowledge/wholesale-price-formation/* /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/ 301

# ── 2026-08-20, director ruling: THE FIVE TABS ARE THE SITE ──────────────────────────────
# "I don't want hidden pages, and I don't want the maintenance and link burden that comes with
# them. Anything not in them either has its content moved into a tab that earns it, or it goes
# and its URL redirects somewhere sensible. No permanent limbo, no page kept because deleting
# it feels risky."
#
# Every directory below is DELETED from the repo, not merely unlinked. Keeping the files while
# hiding the routes is exactly the limbo the ruling names: the pages still had to be kept
# building, kept branded, kept link-checked and kept in every control's page list, for readers
# who could never arrive. Three separate controls broke this week on a stale literal naming one
# of them.
#
# WHERE THE CONTENT WENT, rather than where the URL points:
#   world      -> Capabilities. The world's fidelity is "how far along is this, really".
#   company    -> Capabilities. Same question, the supplier's half of it.
#   proof      -> Harness. Its three jobs re-home: the honest limitations, the corrections
#                 record, and the belief-vs-truth gap (which is what the G13 store audit
#                 grades -- that control moved with the figures, it did not die with the page).
#   evidence   -> Harness. It was an honest hole; the hole is filled there.
#   customers  -> Explore, which now follows a household end to end and supersedes it.
#   now        -> Home, which carries the dated latest strip.
#   glossary   -> Knowledge. Plain English at first use replaces a warehouse of definitions.
#   director   -> Harness, as the "what a human actually decided" section.
#   shadow     -> Harness. An internal mirror that was nonetheless being published.
/world /capabilities/ 301
/world/* /capabilities/ 301
/company /capabilities/ 301
/company/* /capabilities/ 301
/proof /harness/ 301
/proof/* /harness/ 301
/evidence /harness/ 301
/evidence/* /harness/ 301
/customers /explore/ 301
/customers/* /explore/ 301
/now / 301
/now/* / 301
/glossary /knowledge/ 301
/glossary/* /knowledge/ 301
/director /harness/ 301
/director/* /harness/ 301
/shadow /harness/ 301
/shadow/* /harness/ 301
